    "For Process II, should the model require that exactly 70 regular-time hours are used (with any additional production beyond that consuming overtime hours at some overtime cost), or should it simply require that the 70-hour regular capacity is fully used while allowing production to exceed it via overtime without any extra cost?"
  ],
